# Build context for the query layer image. See the note in client.Dockerfile.dockerignore.
#
# This build reads three files from `deploy/images/`, `query/`, and `libs/harness_core` — the
# clock, configuration and heartbeat shapes the query layer's plugins import.
#
# The `!libs/harness_core` line below is load-bearing and easy to lose. `libs` is excluded
# because the query layer needs one package out of it and not the rest, and Docker takes the
# last matching pattern, so the exception has to follow the exclusion. Without it the build
# fails at the COPY with `"/libs/harness_core": not found`, which is what it did from the day
# that COPY was added until the day anything first tried to build this image.

.git
.github
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/dist
client
libs
!libs/harness_core
services
site
specs
spikes
docs
tests
config
contracts
scripts
deploy/lib
deploy/seed.d
deploy/droplet
deploy/.env
